TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution - specific surface area 1.0, rate constant 10 as parm2

SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2.0
    pe        4.0
    units     mmol/kgw
    Cu        10.0
    Ba        5.0
    -water    1.0  # kg

KINETICS 1
Calcite
    -tol    1e-8
    -m0     1.0
    -m      1.0
    -parms  1.0  10.0
    -step   1000 in 100
    -bad_step_max 500

INCREMENTAL_REACTIONS true

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   calcite_kinetics4.out
    -reset  false
    -step
    -time
    -pH
    -pe
    -si     Witherite Calcite

END
